msgid "Using SoftBody3D"
msgstr "使用 SoftBody3D"

msgid ""
"Soft bodies (or *soft-body dynamics*) simulate movement, changing shape and "
"other physical properties of deformable objects. For example, this can be "
"used to simulate cloth or to create more realistic characters."
msgstr ""
"柔體（或\\ *柔體動力學*\\ ）模擬可變形物體的運動，改變形狀和其他物理特性。例"
"如，這個功能可以用於模擬布料或建立更逼真的角色。"

msgid "Physics engine considerations"
msgstr "物理引擎相關注意事項"

msgid ""
"Support for soft bodies is generally more robust in Jolt Physics compared to "
"GodotPhysics3D. You can switch physics engines by changing **Physics > 3D > "
"Physics Engine** in the Project Settings. Projects created in Godot 4.6 and "
"later use Jolt Physics by default, but existing projects will have to be "
"switched over manually."
msgstr ""
"與 GodotPhysics3D 相比，Jolt 物理系統對柔體的支援通常更加強大。你可以通過在專"
"案設定中更改 **物理引擎 > 3D > 物理引擎** 選項來更換物理引擎。Godot 4.6 及更"
"高版本建立的專案預設使用 Jolt 物理系統，但現有專案需要手動切換。"

msgid ""
"Additionally, :ref:`physics interpolation <doc_physics_interpolation>` "
"currently does not affect soft bodies. If you want soft body simulation to "
"look smoother at higher framerates, you'll have to increase the **Physics > "
"Common > Physics Ticks per Second** project setting, which comes at a "
"performance cost."
msgstr ""
"此外，\\ :ref:`physics interpolation <doc_physics_interpolation>` 目前不會影"
"響柔體。如果希望在較高影格率下柔體模擬看起來更平滑，需要增加專案設定 **物理 "
"> 通用 > 每秒物理週期數** 的值，但這會帶來效能開銷。"

msgid "Basic setup"
msgstr "基本設定"

msgid ""
"A :ref:`SoftBody3D <class_SoftBody3D>` node is used for soft body "
"simulations. Unlike other physics body nodes like :ref:`RigidBody3D "
"<class_RigidBody3D>` or :ref:`StaticBody3D <class_StaticBody3D>`, it does "
"**not** have a :ref:`CollisionShape3D <class_CollisionShape3D>` or "
"a :ref:`MeshInstance3D <class_MeshInstance3D>` child node. Instead, the "
"collision shape is derived from the mesh assigned to the node. This mesh is "
"also directly used for rendering, which means you don't need to create any "
"child nodes for a functional, visible setup."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SoftBody3D <class_SoftBody3D>` 節點用於柔體模擬。與其他物理體節點"
"（如 :ref:`RigidBody3D <class_RigidBody3D>` 或 :ref:`StaticBody3D "
"<class_StaticBody3D>`\\ ）不同，它 **沒有** :ref:`CollisionShape3D "
"<class_CollisionShape3D>` 或 :ref:`MeshInstance3D <class_MeshInstance3D>` 子"
"節點。相反，碰撞形狀由分配給該節點的網格自動生成。該網格也直接用於渲染，這意"
"味著你無需建立任何子節點即可獲得可用且可見的柔體效果。"

msgid "We will create a bouncy cube to demonstrate the setup of a soft body."
msgstr "我們將建立一個彈性立方體來演示柔體的設定。"

msgid ""
"Create a new scene with a Node3D node as root. Then, create a SoftBody3D "
"node. Add a BoxMesh in the **Mesh** property of the node in the inspector "
"and increase the subdivision of the mesh for simulation."
msgstr ""
"建立一個以 Node3D 節點為根的新場景。然後，建立一個 SoftBody3D 節點。在屬性檢"
"視器中，將 **Mesh** 屬性設定為 BoxMesh，並增加網格的細分（subdivision）等級以"
"用於模擬。"

msgid ""
"The subdivision level determines the precision level of the deformation, "
"with higher values allowing for smaller and more detailed deformations, at "
"the cost of performance. In this example, we'll set it to 3 on each axis:"
msgstr ""
"細分（ Subdivision ）等級決定變形的精度，數值越高可以實現更小、更精細的變形，"
"但會帶來效能開銷。在此範例中，我們將在每個軸上將其設定為 3："

msgid "Adjusting BoxMesh properties in the inspector"
msgstr "在屬性檢視器中調整 BoxMesh 屬性"

msgid ""
"Now, set the parameters to obtain the type of soft body you aim for. Try to "
"keep the **Simulation Precision** above 5; otherwise, the soft body may "
"collapse."
msgstr ""
"現在，設定各項參數以獲得所需型別的柔體。盡量將 **Simulation Precision（模擬精"
"度）** 保持在 5 以上，否則柔體可能會塌陷。"

msgid "Adjusting SoftBody3D simulation properties in the inspector"
msgstr "在屬性檢視器中調整 SoftBody3D 的模擬屬性"

msgid ""
"Handle some parameters with care, as some values can lead to strange "
"results. For example, if the shape is not completely closed and you set "
"pressure to a value greater than ``0.0``, the soft body will fly around like "
"a plastic bag under strong wind."
msgstr ""
"某些參數需要謹慎處理，因為不當數值可能導致異常效果。例如，如果形狀沒有完全封"
"閉且將壓力（pressure）設定為大於 ``0.0`` 的值，柔體可能會像受強風吹拂的塑料袋"
"一樣飛來飛去。"

msgid ""
"Run the scene to view the simulation. Here's an example of what it should "
"look like:"
msgstr "執行場景以查看模擬效果。以下是範例效果："

msgid ""
"To improve the simulation's result, increase the **Simulation Precision**. "
"This can give a significant improvement at the cost of performance."
msgstr ""
"要改善模擬效果，可以提高 **Simulation Precision**\\ 。這可以顯著提升效果，但"
"會帶來效能開銷。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can increase the **Physics > Common > Physics Ticks per "
"Second** project setting, which will also affect soft body simulation "
"quality."
msgstr ""
"另外，你也可以增加專案設定中的 **物理 > 通用 > 每秒物理週期數** 的值，這也會"
"影響柔體模擬的品質。"

msgid "Cloak simulation"
msgstr "斗篷模擬"

msgid "Let's make a cloak in the Platformer 3D demo."
msgstr "我們將在 Platformer3D 演示中製作一條鬥篷。"

msgid ""
"You can download the Platformer 3D demo on `GitHub <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/3d/platformer>`_ or `the Asset "
"Library <https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/2748>`_."
msgstr ""
"你可以在 `GitHub <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/"
"master/3d/platformer>`_ 或\\ `素材庫 <https://godotengine.org/asset-library/"
"asset/2748>`_\\ 上下載 Platformer3D 演示。"

msgid ""
"Open the ``player/player.tscn`` scene, add a ``SoftBody3D`` node below the "
"root node, then assign a PlaneMesh resource to it in its **Mesh** property."
msgstr ""
"打開 ``player/player.tscn`` 場景，在根節點下新增一個 ``SoftBody3D`` 節點，然"
"後在其 **Mesh** 屬性中分配一個 PlaneMesh 資源。"

msgid ""
"Open the PlaneMesh's properties and set the size to ``(0.5, 1.0)``, then set "
"**Subdivide Width** and **Subdivide Depth** to ``5``. Adjust the SoftBody3D "
"node's position and rotation so that the plane appears to be close to the "
"character's back. You should end up with something like this:"
msgstr ""
"打開 PlaneMesh 的屬性，將尺寸（Size）設定為 ``(0.5, 1.0)``\\ ，然後將 "
"**Subdivide Width** 和 **Subdivide Depth** 設定為 ``5``\\ 。調整 SoftBody3D "
"節點的位置和旋轉，使平面看起來靠近角色的背部。最終效果應類似如下："

msgid "Subdividing the PlaneMesh and placing it on the character's back"
msgstr "對 PlaneMesh 進行細分（Subdivision）並將其放置在角色的背部"

msgid ""
"Subdivision generates a more tessellated mesh for better simulations. "
"However, higher subdivision levels will impact performance. Try to find a "
"balance between performance and quality. This depends on the number of soft "
"body simulations that you expect to be active at a given time, as well as "
"the distance between the camera and the soft body."
msgstr ""
"細分會生成更多三角面片的網格，以獲得更好的模擬效果。然而，較高的細分等級會影"
"響效能。請嘗試在效能與品質之間找到平衡。這取決於同時活躍的柔體模擬數量，以及"
"相機與柔體之間的距離。"

msgid ""
"Add a :ref:`BoneAttachment3D <class_BoneAttachment3D>` node under the "
"skeleton node and select the Neck bone to attach the cloak to the character "
"skeleton."
msgstr ""
"在骨架節點下新增 :ref:`BoneAttachment3D <class_BoneAttachment3D>`，然後選擇 "
"Neck 骨骼，將斗篷綁定在角色骨架上。"

msgid ""
"The BoneAttachment3D node is used to attach objects to a bone of an "
"armature. The attached object will follow the bone's movement. For example, "
"a character's held weapon can be attached this way."
msgstr ""
"BoneAttachment3D 節點用於將物件附著到骨骼（armature）的某根骨頭上。附著的物件"
"會跟隨骨骼的移動。例如，角色手持的武器可以通過這種方式附著。"

msgid ""
"Do **not** move the SoftBody3D node under the BoneAttachment3D node as of "
"now. Instead, we'll configure its *pinned points* to follow the "
"BoneAttachment3D node."
msgstr ""
"目前 **不要** 將 SoftBody3D 節點移動到 BoneAttachment3D 節點下。我們將通過設"
"定其 *pinned points* 來使其跟隨 BoneAttachment3D 節點。"

msgid "Configuring the BoneAttachment3D node in the inspector"
msgstr "在屬性檢視器中設定 BoneAttachment3D 節點"

msgid ""
"To create pinned points, select the upper vertices in the SoftBody3D node. A "
"pinned point appears blue in the 3D editor viewport:"
msgstr ""
"要建立固定頂點（pinned points），在 SoftBody3D 節點中選擇上方的頂點。在 3D 編"
"輯器視埠中，固定頂點會顯示為藍色："

msgid "Pinning the SoftBody3D's points in the inspector"
msgstr "在屬性檢視器中固定 SoftBody3D 的頂點"

msgid ""
"The pinned joints can be found in SoftBody3D's **Attachments** section, "
"which is under the **Collision** section that must be expanded first. Choose "
"the BoneAttachment3D node as the **Spatial Attachment Path** for each pinned "
"joint. The pinned joints are now attached to the neck."
msgstr ""
"固定頂點（pinned points）位於 SoftBody3D 的 **Attachments** 部分，該部分在 "
"**Collision** 下方，需要先展開 Collision。為每個固定頂點擊擇 "
"BoneAttachment3D 節點作為 **Spatial Attachment Path**\\ 。現在，固定頂點已附"
"著到角色的頸部。"

msgid ""
"To assign the properties faster, you can drag-and-drop the BoneAttachment3D "
"node from the scene tree dock to the **Spatial Attachment Path** property "
"field."
msgstr ""
"為了更快速地分配屬性，你可以將場景樹面板中的 BoneAttachment3D 節點拖放到 "
"**Spatial Attachment Path** 屬性欄位中。"

msgid ""
"Note that you may have to deselect then reselect the SoftBody3D node for the "
"**Attachments** section to appear."
msgstr ""
"請注意，你可能需要先取消選中再重新選中 SoftBody3D 節點，\\ **Attachments** 部"
"分才會顯示。"

msgid ""
"Configuring pinned points to be attached to the BoneAttachment3D node in the "
"SoftBody3D inspector"
msgstr ""
"在 SoftBody3D 屬性檢視器中，把 pinned points 附著到 BoneAttachment3D 節點"

msgid ""
"The last step is to avoid clipping by adding the CharacterBody3D ``Player`` "
"(the scene's root node) to the **Parent Collision Ignore** property of the "
"SoftBody3D."
msgstr ""
"最後一步，為避免穿透，將 CharacterBody3D 節點 ``Player``\\ （場景的根節點）新"
"增到 SoftBody3D 的 **Parent Collision Ignore** 屬性中。"

msgid "Setting up the collision exception in the SoftBody3D inspector"
msgstr "在 SoftBody3D 屬性檢視器中設定碰撞例外（collision exception）"

msgid "Play the scene and the cloak should simulate correctly."
msgstr "播放場景，應該已經正確模擬了斗篷。"

msgid "Final result when running the project's main scene"
msgstr "執行專案主場景後的最終效果"

msgid ""
"This covers the basic settings of a soft body simulation. Experiment with "
"the parameters to achieve the effect you are aiming for when making your "
"game."
msgstr ""
"以上介紹了柔體模擬的基本設定。在製作遊戲時，可以根據目標效果自行嘗試和調整這"
"些參數。"

msgid ""
"The cloak will not appear when viewed from certain angles due to backface "
"culling. To resolve this, you can disable backface culling by assigning a "
"new StandardMaterial3D, then setting its cull mode to **Disabled**. This "
"will make the material render both sides of the plane."
msgstr ""
"由於背面剔除（backface culling），鬥篷在某些角度下可能不會顯示。為解決此問"
"題，你可以為其分配一個新的 StandardMaterial3D，然後將其剔除模式（Cull Mode）"
"設定為 **Disabled**\\ 。這樣材質就會渲染平面的兩面。"

msgid "Using imported meshes"
msgstr "使用匯入的網格"

msgid ""
"The **Save to File** option in the Advanced Import Settings dialog allows "
"you to save a mesh to a standalone resource file that you can then attach to "
"SoftBody3D nodes."
msgstr ""
"進階匯入設定對話框中的 **Save to File** 選項允許你將網格儲存為一個獨立的資源"
"檔案，之後即可將其分配給 SoftBody3D 節點使用。"

msgid ""
"You may also want to disable LOD generation or change the LOD generation "
"options when importing a mesh for use with SoftBody3D. The default import "
"settings will produce an LOD that merges adjacent faces that are nearly flat "
"with respect to each other, even at very close render distances. This works "
"well for static meshes, but is often undesirable for use with SoftBody3D if "
"you want these faces to be able to bend and move with respect to each other, "
"instead of being rendered as a single plane."
msgstr ""
"在匯入用於 SoftBody3D 的網格時，你可能還需要停用 LOD 生成功能，或調整 LOD 的"
"生成選項。預設的匯入設定會生成 LOD，並在渲染距離非常近時，仍會將彼此幾乎共面"
"的相鄰面合併在一起。這種方式非常適合靜態網格，但如果用於 SoftBody3D 往往並不"
"理想，因為你通常希望這些面能夠相互彎曲、獨立運動，而不是被當作一個單一的平面"
"來渲染。"

msgid ""
"See :ref:`doc_importing_3d_scenes_import_configuration` "
"and :ref:`doc_mesh_lod` for more details."
msgstr ""
"詳情請見 :ref:`doc_importing_3d_scenes_import_configuration` "
"與 :ref:`doc_mesh_lod`。"
